      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GIVE A LITTLE (8) was well supported last time but could only manage second (25.14), beaten 4.5 lengths. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Rates highly and will give a great sight. ARMATREE PASTA (4) has a strong record this trip with three wins and two placings from seven starts. Scored by 0.8 lengths last time (25.19) in a Grade 5 over 431m at this track. Looks one of the chances. VICTOR CARGO (7) tends to take a while to wind up, running on to score two back before spotting a start latest and finishing on strongly into third (30.94) in a Grade 4/5 at this track. Yet to miss the placings from three starts out of this box. Expected to be in the finish again. ARMATREE JUDO (2) hit the frame latest (25.24) when third at this track in a Grade 5. Already a winner from this draw.",
